--   # Opp-bank BitNB corrected densified GREC, pack 0 (variant R)
--
--   This is the first packed half of the corrected densified producer-record table for the opp-bank bit network DAG on $n=62478$ nodes. It contains $142$ natural-number chunks, each holding at most $256$ records, using the same bit layout as the published table $\texttt{IntMul\_Kappa\_R8\_Data\_BitOppbankLocGrecDense}$. A packed chunk $X\in\mathbb{N}$ stores a record count in its low sixteen bits and a payload in the remaining bits.
